#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
