#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT"
