#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.BROKEN"
