#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.WORKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.WORKING"
