#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE"
