#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE"
