#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
