#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL.GENERIC"
